            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Just Ingredients is our top pick for most people, because it makes a good-tasting complete shake from recognizable foods without gums or artificial sweeteners. If you want a single food, Sprout Living pumpkin seed, Nutiva hemp and Naked Egg are one-ingredient powders that stay close to their source."
